[106.06932,125.58514],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client","bbox":[187.41733,113.23909,257.10233,128.35309],"origin":[187.41733,125.06409],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information","bbox":[74.03149,139.87529,329.95145,159.15329],"origin":[74.03149,154.85529],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"A total score is presented (0 - 27) where a higher score is indicative","bbox":[187.41733,159.96785,515.71228,175.08185],"origin":[187.41733,171.79285],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"of more severe problematic gambling behaviours. ","bbox":[187.41733,172.06783,431.34225,187.18182],"origin":[187.41733,183.89282],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"For ease of reference, a severity index is provided for the total score","bbox":[187.41733,196.26784,519.3974,211.38184],"origin":[187.41733,208.09283],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"based upon prior research. Scores of 0 are considered to be a","bbox":[187.41733,208.36781,490.07135,223.48181],"origin":[187.41733,220.19281],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"severity of \"none\", scores of 1-4 are considered \"low\", scores of 5-7","bbox":[187.41733,220.46779,515.44836,235.58179],"origin":[187.41733,232.29279],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"are considered \"moderate\" and scores of 8 and above are","bbox":[187.41733,232.56783,469.14935,247.68182],"origin":[187.41733,244.39282],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"considered to be \"problematic\" severity (Currie et al., 2010; Currie et","bbox":[187.41733,244.6678,519.84827,259.7818],"origin":[187.41733,256